        // The shared Pinch-fusion charge (the Regency's fusion guns and titans that have no
        // charge of their own), heard about 2.2 s before the shot: the plasma squeezed until
        // it fuses. It starts low and quiet so the end can be big: a deep field clunk, the
        // air drawn in, a gravity heave throbbing slowly under a growl that fills and only
        // leans up, then the core going white: an overload growl an octave up, until the
        // pinch slams shut on the launch.
