        // The Sunspear's own Pinch-fusion Cannon (`regency_t3_point_defense`), heard 2.2 s
        // before its one shot; nothing else shares this set. Not a star filling up but a
        // heavy gun pulling the air into its bore: a pneumatic gasp as the split bore parts,
        // then a vortex closing in (one band coming down, one coming up, a roar spinning
        // faster) over a deep heave that swells and throbs faster as it fills, all of it
        // continuous: nothing is struck, no knocks or clanks (the user heard them as wood).
        // The pinch locks as a soft deep whump and the gun holds its breath for the last
