        // ---- The Lodestone: the Regency's gravitic lens (tech 3) ----
        // The Lodestone (`regency_t3_gravitic_lens`): The Fallen's family on a gun a tank's size,
        // so shorter, tighter and nearer, with no lightning (nothing it does glows). Its weapon's
        // `sounds` name them all; mc-game audio/lens.rs drives the front, strike, well and
        // release. No beeps: every pitched voice is a rough Fm growl (ratio 0.5), and nothing
        // rings on a note.
        //
        // The charge, 1.6 s, exactly the weapon's `charge_time` (the launch is heard as it
        // ends): the crown taking hold with a dull clunk, a rough growl deep in it leaning
        // slowly up as the pinpoint swells, the air drawn in with its band rising, grit hissing
        // in and pebbles knocking against the crown, more of them toward the end, and one
        // tight breath in.
        "regency_lens_charge": (
            length: 1.6, peak: 0.55, room: 0.25,
            layers: [
                // The crown taking hold: a dull clunk deep in the body.
                Burst(low: 45, high: 380, attack: 0.001, decay: 0.05, gain: 4, seed: 12001),
                Tone(from: 64, to: 40, glide: 0.2, attack: 0.003, decay: 0.3, gain: 0.7),
                // The pinpoint swelling: a rough growl and its voice above leaning slowly up.
                Fm(at: 0.04, from: 38, to: 62, glide: 1.42, ratio: 0.5, index: 2.2, fade: 1000, attack: 1.42, decay: 0.025, gain: 0.7),
                Fm(at: 0.2, from: 80, to: 128, glide: 1.26, ratio: 0.5, index: 1.5, fade: 1000, attack: 1.26, decay: 0.025, gain: 0.42, pan: -0.15),
                Drive(1.5),
                // The pressure heaving under it, quicker as it fills.
                Roll(at: 0.05, from: 160, to: 320, glide: 1.4, attack: 1.41, decay: 0.025, gain: 0.8, swell: 6, depth: 0.7, seed: 12002),
                // The air drawn in, its band rising, and the grit hissing in with it.
